      508.13,
      401.88,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of Councillors as specifiedby the Minister by Order made underparagraph (a), who shall be returnedin terms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and",
